    "created_at": "2016-07-16T00:08:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-16T00:08:07Z",
    "body": "This is not even about document conformance.  The current spec mandates that `1.` be parsed as an invalid string in `HTMLInputElement` and falls back to an empty string, and we have a W3C test for this:\nhttp://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/number.html\n",
