    "created_at": "2016-08-09T03:59:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-09T03:59:51Z",
    "body": "Sorry for the delay on this, everyone. If I am understanding correctly, there is a spec bug here: it should error out in the step @keith-rollin points out (\"rules for parsing floating-point number values\" step 13.2), instead of jumping to the step labeled \"conversion\". Is that correct?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
